WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:01.134
- action.

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.335
- hey, have you ever
found yourself

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:05.004
in high point, north carolina,
and not feeling safe?

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:08.941
come on down to doug duggart's
brazilian jiu jitsu.

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:11.077
you will learn
to tackle and grapple,

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.879
[gong rings]
and--

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.481
[gong echoing]

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:17.550
like a ultimate fighting pro.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.819
at my studio, you get
hands-on training,

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:21.587
[both grunting]

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.256
and individual attention.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:27.460
so hut! hut!
[grunting]

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:29.162
tackle and grapple.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.764
take on multiple enemies.

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:34.767
this is a tackle.
that's a grapple.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.769
this is a tackle.

00:00:36.802 --> 00:00:38.337
that's a grapple.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.906
get--there we go.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.774
[grunts]

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.176
tackle and grapple!

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:47.213
all ages, learn to protect
yourself and your loved ones.

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:54.987
there are many
different levels.

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:56.522
there's the beginner level,

00:00:56.555 --> 00:01:00.393
and if you pass my private
one-on-one sensei trial,

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:03.663
you may make it
into the advanced class.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:04.831
tackle and grapple!

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.432
doug duggart's
brazilian jiu jitsu

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:08.634
at the high point mini mall.
just east of the pizza barn

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:11.304
two doors down from carl's
discount wheels and furniture.

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.805
so--quick tackle!
get down. [grunts]

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:14.340
[muttering]

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:16.943
[all grunting]

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.511
no, stay--stay away.

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:20.513
special discounts
for college students.

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:22.148
s--mm, move it.
get your leg back.

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:23.316
[gong rings]

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:26.686
put your leg back there.
[gong echoing]

